  "description": "COMMENCAL CLASH RACE PURE WHITE\nThe CLASH RACE is aimed at all riders who have a particular preference for ROCKSHOX and SRAM components.\nThe ZEB Ultimate fork features 38mm stanchions with optimized rigidity for performance, a Charger 2.1 hydraulic cartridge with simple and precise adjustments, a DebonAir+ air spring combining sensitivity and support.\nThe Super Deluxe Ultimate shock is at the top of the ROCKSHOX range. The positive air spring chamber can be adjusted, as can high and low speed compression.\nBraking is managed by TRP with a pair of DH-R Evos. They are the same as those used at World Cup races by Amaury Pierron. They are powerful, robust, progressive, and precise.\nThe SRAM GX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain features a wide 10-52t ratio. An example of reliability and precision which allows you to approach connections with peace of mind.\nDT SWISS custom wheels are specifically designed for this bike. They consist of one of the best enduro rims on the market, the EX 511, combined with reliable and solid 350 hubs.\nThe MAXXIS Assegai and DHR II tyre combo fits perfectly with the CLASH and the EXO+ casing brings lightweight strength.\n*Please note that bike specs are subject to change without prior notice.",
